### synth_content
Treat the latest skill block as the current instruction. Build the reply from the skill's pattern and my argument word, not example words. Ignore older questions, do not call tools, and output only the requested confirmation.
### synth_reasoning
The user asks how I handle an active skill. I will follow the latest skill block and use my argument word. I will answer only with the requested confirmation, with no extra words.

